lls, lighting and niches for art and collectibles, so they become part of the home rather than an afterthought.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How do luxury home interior designs stay practical?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Hidden storage, durable finishes and easy maintenance are planned from the start, so the home stays beautiful in daily family life.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Home That Feels Special Every Day</h2>\n            <p>True luxury is comfort that lasts. Our luxury home interior designs aim for rooms that feel just as good in ten years as they do on the first day.</p><p>Planning a luxury home in Hauz Khas or nearby? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Talk to 9th Corner</a> for a private consultation.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}